{"study_accession":"PRJNA433825","secondary_study_accession":"SRP132689","title":"Helios enhances the preferential differentiation of human fetal CD4+ naïve T cells into regulatory T cells. [RNA-Seq - ex vivo]","description":"RNA sequencing was used to compare the transcriptome of ex vivo isolated adult and fetal naïve and regulatory T (Treg) cells. A Treg-specific transcriptome was defined by genes upregulated and downregulated preferentially in adult and fetal Treg cells relative to adult naive T cells. Fetal naive T cells show an intermediate expression of genes in the Treg-specific transcriptome. Overall design: RNA sequencing for 4 biological replicates of ex vivo sorted CD4+CD25-CD45RA+CD27+ naïve and CD4+CD25hiCD127lo Treg cells from fetal spleen and adult peripheral blood mononuclear cells.","pubmed":"31757834","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN08518230","study_accession":"PRJNA433825","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"AdultNaive2","description":"AdultNaive2","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM2991652","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2019-11-29","attributes":[["source_name","Human PBMCs"],["cell_type","adult CD4+CD25-CD45RA+CD27+ naive T cells"],["tissue","Human PBMCs"],["age","35 years"],["sex","male"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR6706571","experiment_accession":"SRX3680679","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 3000","read_count":21938636,"base_count":1086694849,"first_public":"2019-11-29","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 3000 sequencing: GSM2991652: AdultNaive2 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN08518231","study_accession":"PRJNA433825","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"AdultNaive1","description":"AdultNaive1","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM2991651","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2019-11-29","attributes":[["source_name","Human PBMCs"],["cell_type","adu